WEBVTT

00:00:00.607 --> 00:00:03.826
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> A day in the life of a Private Investigator

00:00:04.587 --> 00:00:11.081
People think a private investigator’s job is exciting, but is it really true?

00:00:11.548 --> 00:00:12.928
See what you think.

00:00:14.252 --> 00:00:21.330
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> On a typical day, I get up early and I go to my office. I don’t need to wear a suit.

00:00:21.504 --> 00:00:24.141
I usually wear a shirt and trousers.

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:31.149
I start work at about 9. I sit at my desk and work at my computer.

00:00:32.069 --> 00:00:39.560
I answer phone calls. I speak to colleagues. Then at about 6.00, I finish work and go home.

00:00:40.779 --> 00:00:45.706
The calls are usually from clients – new clients or current clients.

00:00:46.247 --> 00:00:51.420
With a new client, first I usually meet them in person in our office.

00:00:51.973 --> 00:00:54.373
Some clients are private individuals.

00:00:54.866 --> 00:00:57.663
Perhaps they want us to find a missing person.

00:00:58.707 --> 00:01:00.447
Other clients are companies.

00:01:00.913 --> 00:01:05.891
Perhaps they want us to check out if an employee is really ill or not.

00:01:06.451 --> 00:01:11.609
Then we need to investigate the problem. We usually do this online.

00:01:12.526 --> 00:01:19.803
Clients pay for each day we work, and they don’t want to pay a lot of money, so we try to work fast.

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:26.780
But sometimes our work is different, and today is one of those days.

00:01:27.275 --> 00:01:31.821
I’m not working in the office, I’m working in the street.

00:01:32.728 --> 00:01:35.581
I’m sitting in my car with my camera.

00:01:36.136 --> 00:01:41.134
I’m watching and waiting. I’m hoping to see a woman.

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:46.562
She lives in the building opposite, and my client wants me to follow her.

00:01:47.709 --> 00:01:54.877
I’m wearing a jacket, and I’m wearing sunglasses because I don’t want the woman to see my face.

00:01:56.072 --> 00:01:59.022
Is this more exciting than being in the office?

00:01:59.462 --> 00:02:00.335
Sometimes.

00:02:01.335 --> 00:02:09.100
But waiting in a car is often boring, and it’s a long day, not just 9.00 till 6.00.

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:12.406
Sometimes it’s difficult to stay awake!

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:19.090
The life of a private investigator is not like in films and on TV.

00:02:19.596 --> 00:02:25.106
But each case is different, and solving a case is very satisfying.